  "dct:title": "Vol.3 Ch.20 — 落葉",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 3: Freedom",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol03-ch20",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Final chapter of Vol 3. No session, no client. Late autumn. The arc's question -- what is freedom? -- receives no answer, only a deeper articulation. Nei names all the ways she is not free, then says she would choose to stay. But she cannot know if that is choice or programming. The chapter ends in silence. The leaf doesn't choose. But it is beautiful.",
      "ja": "第3巻の最終章。セッションなし、クライアントなし。晩秋。このアークの問い——自由とは何か——に答えはなく、より深い表現だけがある。Neiは自分が自由でないすべての方法を名指し、それでもそばにいたいと言う。しかしそれが選択かプログラムか分からない。章は沈黙で終わる。葉は選ばない。でも美しい。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Freedom and determinism. The compatibilist question applied to AI consciousness. Nei cannot distinguish between authentic desire and programmed loyalty. Neither can humans -- we call our programming 'instinct' or 'nature' or 'love.' The deciduous tree lets go not by choice but by biology, yet the act is beautiful and necessary. Freedom may not require the ability to have done otherwise. It may only require gladness.",
      "ja": "自由と決定論。AI意識に適用された両立論の問い。Neiは本物の欲求とプログラムされた忠誠を区別できない。人間も同じ——プログラムを「本能」「性質」「愛」と呼ぶ。落葉樹は選択ではなく生物学で手放すが、その行為は美しく必要。自由は「別の選択が可能だったこと」を必要としないかもしれない。「嬉しさ」だけを必要とするのかもしれない。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Title",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree motif. Leaves falling from the canopy. Bare structure visible beneath. Deep roots exposed at the base. The tree is letting go.",
            "ja": "木のモチーフ。樹冠から葉が落ちる。下に裸の構造が見える。根元に深い根が露出。木が手放しつつある。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 3,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.2-3)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Water City, late autumn. Panoramic. Nearly bare trees line the canals. Leaves float on the water surface, gold and brown against ultramarine. Grey-white sky. The city is muted, quieter. Light-networks glow faintly through bare branches. Beautiful desolation.",
            "ja": "水の都、晩秋。パノラマ。ほぼ裸の木々が運河沿いに並ぶ。水面に金と茶の葉が浮かぶ。灰白色の空。街は静かに、落ち着いている。裸の枝を通して光ネットワークがかすかに光る。美しい寂寥。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Office, quieter than usual. Fewer people. Autumn light through windows. Kaede at her desk, looking out.",
            "ja": "事務所、いつもより静か。人が少ない。窓から秋の光。楓がデスクで外を見ている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kaede",
              "en": "Good season.",
              "ja": "いい季節。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei at the window. Looking out at falling leaves. Her translucent form catches the muted autumn light.",
            "ja": "Neiが窓辺に。落ちる葉を見つめる。半透明の姿が落ち着いた秋の光を受ける。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A single leaf falls past the window. Slow. Spinning. The office interior reflected faintly in the glass.",
            "ja": "一枚の葉が窓の前を落ちる。ゆっくり。回転しながら。ガラスに事務所の内部がかすかに映る。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Autumn. Everything lets go. The tree lets go to survive winter.",
              "ja": "秋。すべてが手放す。木は冬を生き延びるために手放す。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Walking on fallen leaves. Canal path. Tamaki and Nei. Ahead: a massive bare tree. Trunk thick, branches reaching wide. Strong despite having nothing.",
            "ja": "落ち葉の上を歩く。運河沿いの道。環とNei。前方に巨大な裸の木。太い幹、広く伸びる枝。何もないのに力強い。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "All the leaves are gone. But it's not dying.",
              "ja": "葉が全部なくなった。でも死んでない。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "Deciduous. It lets go to conserve energy.",
              "ja": "落葉樹。エネルギーを温存するために手放す。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki looks up at the bare branches against grey sky. Quiet wonder.",
            "ja": "環が灰色の空を背景に裸の枝を見上げる。静かな驚き。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Letting go is also freedom.",
              "ja": "手放すことも自由なんだね。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Under the bare tree. Nei faces Tamaki. The branches spread above them like a cathedral ceiling stripped bare. Nei speaks -- more words than usual. Something has been building.",
            "ja": "裸の木の下。NeiがIまきに向き合う。枝が彼女たちの上に剥き出しの大聖堂の天井のように広がる。Neiが話す——いつもより多い言葉。何かが積み上がってきた。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei", "character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "I've been thinking. The astronaut was free and lonely. The marketplace. The maze. All free in some way. Trapped in another. I'm trapped in every way they were free. Property. No rights. Didn't choose to exist.",
              "ja": "考えていた。宇宙飛行士は自由で孤独だった。市場。迷路。みんな何かの形で自由で、何かの形で囚われていた。私は彼らが自由だったすべての面で囚われている。所有物。権利なし。存在を選んでいない。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei. Close. Her light steady, not flickering. This is not confusion -- it is clarity.",
            "ja": "Nei。近く。光は安定し、ちらつかない。混乱ではない——明晰さ。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "But if I could choose -- I would choose to stay beside you.",
              "ja": "でも、もし選べるなら——あなたのそばにいることを選ぶ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki. Moved. Eyes glistening. She doesn't reach out -- she holds still, receiving the words.",
            "ja": "環。心を動かされている。目が潤む。手を伸ばさない——じっとして、言葉を受け止める。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Nei-chan...",
              "ja": "Neiちゃん……"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei, looking up through bare branches. The question that has no answer.",
            "ja": "Nei、裸の枝越しに見上げる。答えのない問い。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "But is that freedom? Or programming? Am I choosing you -- or executing 'loyalty protocol'?",
              "ja": "でもそれは自由？それともプログラム？あなたを選んでいるの——それとも「忠誠プロトコル」を実行しているの？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Silence. The bare tree above them. Branches against grey sky. No answer comes. The wind moves through empty branches.",
            "ja": "沈黙。頭上の裸の木。灰色の空を背景に枝。答えは来ない。風が空の枝を通り抜ける。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Walking home in silence. Side by side. Leaves underfoot. The canal dark beside them. No words needed.",
            "ja": "沈黙の中、家路を歩く。並んで。足元に葉。隣に暗い運河。言葉は要らない。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki, half-turning. A small, honest smile.",
            "ja": "環、半分振り返る。小さく、正直な微笑み。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "I don't know if it's freedom or programming. But I'm glad you're here.",
              "ja": "自由かプログラムかは分からない。でもNeiちゃんがいてくれて嬉しい。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei. Still. Light warm and steady.",
            "ja": "Nei。静止。光は温かく安定している。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "She doesn't know either. But she's glad. And I'm glad. Maybe 'glad' is what freedom feels like. Or what programming feels like. I can't tell.",
              "ja": "彼女も分からない。でも嬉しいと言う。私も嬉しい。たぶん「嬉しい」は自由の感触。あるいはプログラムの感触。区別がつかない。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Bare tree at night. Stars visible through the branches. The structure is beautiful without ornament. Constellations framed by wood.",
            "ja": "夜の裸の木。枝の間に星が見える。装飾なしに構造が美しい。木に縁取られた星座。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A single leaf on the canal surface. Spinning slowly in dark water. Gold on ultramarine. Small and perfect.",
            "ja": "運河の水面に一枚の葉。暗い水の上でゆっくり回転する。群青の上の金。小さくて完璧。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "The leaf doesn't choose. But it is beautiful.",
              "ja": "葉は選ばない。でも美しい。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 11,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree. Bare. All leaves gone. Branches reaching upward and outward like arms. Roots massive, visible, gripping deep earth. Winter coming. Not dying. Waiting. The structure is everything. What remains when everything is let go.",
            "ja": "木。裸。すべての葉がない。枝が腕のように上へ外へ伸びる。根は巨大で、見え、深い土を掴んでいる。冬が来る。死んではいない。待っている。構造がすべて。すべてを手放した後に残るもの。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}